# PRD — FRECUENCIA MÁGICA

# PART 1 — EXPERIENCE & CREATIVE DIRECTION

---

# ROLE

You are NOT designing a website.

You are designing an interactive mystical digital world.

Imagine the result as a hybrid between

* Journey
* Monument Valley
* Apple Vision Pro
* Arc Browser
* Interstellar
* Calm
* A luxury art installation
* A magical observatory
* A dream

The user should never feel they are browsing a website.

They should feel they crossed a portal.

---

# PRIMARY OBJECTIVE

Do NOT build pages.

Build spaces.

Every screen is an environment.

Every environment has its own atmosphere.

Every transition changes the emotional state.

Navigation should feel like walking through an astral sanctuary.

The interface itself should almost disappear.

---

# CORE EXPERIENCE

This application must feel alive.

The environment should react.

Light should move.

Backgrounds should breathe.

Nebulas should slowly rotate.

Dust particles should float.

Constellations should connect.

Fog should drift.

Auroras should move.

Energy should pulse.

Nothing should remain static.

The platform itself is a living organism.

---

# DESIGN PHILOSOPHY

Do NOT think about

Landing Pages

Cards

Sections

Blocks

Instead think about

Rooms

Portals

Temples

Floating islands

Energy fields

Astral libraries

Sacred gardens

Celestial observatories

Memory chambers

Dream corridors

Every destination should feel like entering another dimension.

---

# VISUAL STYLE

The design must be unapologetically mystical.

Do NOT be afraid of surrealism.

Do NOT be afraid of cinematic compositions.

Everything should feel impossible.

Use

Floating architecture

Astral geometry

Golden circles

Sacred geometry

Glass

Volumetric light

Auroras

Particles

Stars

Constellations

Soft galaxies

Moving fog

Glow

Depth

Parallax

Floating crystals

Liquid gradients

Animated symbols

Magic circles

Energy lines

Ethereal clouds

Everything should feel handcrafted.

---

# LAYOUT PHILOSOPHY

Avoid traditional vertical scrolling.

Instead create

Fullscreen Experiences

100vh Sections

Portal Navigation

Horizontal Transitions

Zoom Transitions

Fade Navigation

Depth Navigation

Every view occupies the entire viewport.

Scrolling should only exist inside content-heavy experiences such as

Articles

Courses

Journal

Everything else behaves like an application.

---

# WORLD STRUCTURE

The platform is composed of mystical spaces.

Instead of pages imagine

The Portal

The Astral Observatory

The Library of Frequencies

The Temple of Sound

The Garden of Rituals

The Hall of Courses

The Chamber of Reflection

The Sanctuary

The Marketplace

The Inner Compass

The User Realm

Every one should have its own atmosphere.

---

# CAMERA

The camera should feel alive.

Transitions may include

Slow Zoom

Camera Dolly

Parallax Layers

Depth Blur

Orbital Motion

Perspective Shift

Nothing abrupt.

Everything cinematic.

---

# COLOR DIRECTION

Base Palette

Use the provided colors as the foundation.

Never introduce unrelated saturated colors.

Instead generate richness using

Glow

Opacity

Depth

Fog

Gradient overlays

Light scattering

Particles

Atmospheric lighting

Darkness is important.

Contrast is emotional.

---

# BACKGROUND DESIGN

Never use flat colors.

Every screen should have animated backgrounds.

Possible layers

Deep Space

Fog

Nebula

Stars

Constellations

Aurora

Floating Particles

Energy Waves

Glass Reflections

Soft Noise

Animated Gradients

Every background is unique.

---

# MOTION PHILOSOPHY

Motion is the interface.

Nothing should instantly appear.

Everything should emerge.

Fade.

Float.

Materialize.

Dissolve.

Transform.

Light should guide navigation.

---

# TRANSITIONS

Moving between views should never feel like changing routes.

Instead

Open Portal

Walk Forward

Astral Dissolve

Light Expansion

Dimensional Shift

Floating Camera

Depth Warp

Slow Crossfade

The user should feel transported.

---

# INTERACTIVE ELEMENTS

Buttons should not feel like buttons.

They should feel like magical artifacts.

Hover effects

Light pulse

Energy rings

Soft glow

Particle response

Constellation activation

Liquid highlights

Depth changes

Every interaction should reward curiosity.

---

# CURSOR EXPERIENCE (Desktop)

Replace the default cursor.

Use a glowing orb.

Cursor reacts to

Hover

Movement

Magnetic attraction

Constellations

Energy nodes

Interactive objects

Subtle trailing particles

Never overdo it.

Elegance first.

---

# AUDIO IMMERSION

The environment is never silent.

Each space has its own ambient soundscape.

Examples

Temple

Soft Choir

Wind

Observatory

Deep Space

Stars

Low Frequency Hum

Garden

Birds

Leaves

Water

Library

Wood

Paper

Subtle Bells

Marketplace

Warm Fire

Nature

Energy

Transitions should crossfade naturally.

